    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="08eb5934-51fd-5dae-9683-9ae647c99a90" activityNameId="5c8206db-6105-5e55-8bd9-2ae636bd837e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Window frame, wood-metal, natural/varnished, frame cover, wall opening, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Window frame, wood-metal, natural/varnished, frame cover, wall opening, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The wall opening is 1.8 m2 (assumption width of frame 0.12m, 2/3 of frame are behind the wall opening). The bill of materials is based on data from 4 window producers.;
UUID: ecdfc095-193e-378f-b770-114b0849318b
Included are the materials used in a wooden-metal window frame with surface treatment and the panelling of the frame. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ecdfc095-193e-378f-b770-114b0849318b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
